<subpara id="RM000000WZP00MX_03" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000WZP00MX_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000000WZP00MX_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00000D100000">
<testtitle>CAN Bus Open Circuit Inspection (A/C ECU Branch Line)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG OFF and disconnect vehicle harness connector B of the air conditioner amplifier assembly (A/C ECU) from the air conditioner amplifier assembly (A/C ECU).</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C147883J06" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Measure the resistance between each pair of terminals of the vehicle harness connector of the air conditioner amplifier assembly (A/C ECU).</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.86in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B11(CANH) - B12(CANL)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IG OFF</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>54 to 69Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000WZP00MX_04_0002" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000000WZP00MX_04_0004" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000WZP00MX_04_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___00000D200000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness (ECU Power Source System)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance and voltage between each terminal of the air conditioner amplifier assembly (A/C ECU) vehicle harness connector and body ground.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C147883J07" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.89in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B14 (GND) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<table>
<title>Voltage</title>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.86in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B1 (IG) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>11 to 14V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000WZP00MX_04_0003" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000000WZP00MX_04_0005" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000WZP00MX_04_0003">
<testtitle>Replace Air Conditioner Amplifier Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000213Z002X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000WZP00MX_04_0004">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Branch Wire or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000WZP00MX_04_0005">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
